    "Scan of the 1953 edition of the Blue Ridge Summit, Pennsylvania, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey, the U.S. Army Corps of Engineers, and the Army Map Service. Aerial photographs from 1981; field checked in 1944; photo revised in 1985; last revised in 1985; printed in 1986.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 27 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
